; Bug repro: a consumer that imports a library which itself
; imports another library under an alias and instantiates an
; aliased generic body must not lose the alias-qualified
; private helper closure that the generic body references.
; Before the fix the consumer emitted an E016 undefined
; reference for the alias-qualified private helper.
;
; Expected after fix: no E016; the helper closure is retained,
; alias-qualified, and visible to the resolver / finalizer.

;# import "./support/bug_003_middle.cddl" as middle

ok = middle.via-alias